@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeSeen::
	.string "See those islands that are\n"
	.string "blocked by whirlpools?\p"
	.string "There just has to be a secret!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeBeaten::
	.string "What's the secret to your\n"
	.string "strength?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermBerkeAfter::
	.string "It was a dark and stormy night…\p"
	.string "I saw this giant Pokémon flying\n"
	.string "from the islands.\p"
	.string "It was scattering feathers\n"
	.string "from its silver wings.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieSeen::
	.string "The water's warm here.\n"
	.string "I'm loose and limber.\p"
	.string "Sure, I'll take you on!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieBeaten::
	.string "Yikes! I've got prune skin!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermCharlieAfter::
	.string "Isn't it relaxing just floating\n"
	.string "like this?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseSeen::
	.string "The weather is so beautiful,\n"
	.string "I'm in a daze!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseBeaten::
	.string "Ohhh!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfDeniseAfter::
	.string "A sunburn is the worst for skin.\p"
	.string "But I don't use a sunblock.\p"
	.string "I won't pollute the water.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraSeen::
	.string "If you need to rest,\n"
	.string "just tread water.\p"
	.string "You'll get your wind back,\n"
	.string "so you can keep on going strong.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraBeaten::
	.string "Oh! You have more energy than I do.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKaraAfter::
	.string "I heard roars from deep inside\n"
	.string "the Islands.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeSeen::
	.string "I'm on my way to Whirl Islands.\p"
	.string "I'm going exploring with friends.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeBeaten::
	.string "Is that how you do it?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfKayleeAfter::
	.string "There's supposed to be a big\n"
	.string "Pokémon deep beneath Whirl Islands.\p"
	.string "I wonder what it could be?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeSeen::
	.string "I'm a bit tired.\n"
	.string "If I win, lend me your Pokémon.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeBeaten::
	.string "Pant, pant…$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermGeorgeAfter::
	.string "It's so far to Cianwood.\p"
	.string "But it's no easy return trip\n"
	.string "to Olivine either.\p"
	.string "What should I do?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkSeen::
	.string "The waves are wild here.\p"
	.string "They tire you out while\n"
	.string "you swim.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkBeaten::
	.string "I'm beat!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermKirkAfter::
	.string "The currents keep me from\n"
	.string "reaching that island.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieSeen::
	.string "You look so elegant,\n"
	.string "riding your Pokémon.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieBeaten::
	.string "I'm crushed…$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfSusieAfter::
	.string "Wasn't there a hit song about\n"
	.string "a boy riding a Lapras?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewSeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewSeen::
	.string "Are you seeking the secrets\n"
	.string "of Whirl Islands?$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewBeaten::
	.string "Ooh, you've got great endurance!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewAfter
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmermMathewAfter::
	.string "A secret about Whirl Islands…\p"
	.string "It's pitch-black inside!$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfWendySeen
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfWendySeen::
	.string "At night, Staryu gather near\n"
	.string "the water's surface.$"

@ HNS_modern data/maps/Route41/scripts.inc: Route41_Text_SwimmerfWendyBeaten
Johto_Route41_Text_SwimmerfWendyBeaten::
	.string "Oh, dear…$"

